      "definition": "As used in sections 709.43 to 709.48 of the Revised Code, \"merger\" means the annexation, one to another, of existing municipal corporations or of the unincorporated area of a township with one or more municipal corporations, or the merger of one or more municipal corporations with the unincorporated area of a township.",
